on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <0>
  [  3] extcall 83 .............................. puppetSound(0)
  [  5] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  7] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  8] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 10] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to 0
  [ 12] pushsymb 100 ............................ <#stop>
  [ 14] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 16] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2>
  [ 18] extcall 101 ............................. sound stop 2
  [ 20] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 22] extcall 99 .............................. unloadMember()
  [ 24] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 26] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <4>
  [ 28] extcall 78 .............................. cursor(4)
  [ 30] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 32] pushcons 0 .............................. <"kalender">
  [ 34] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1, "kalender">
  [ 36] extcall 1 ............................... go(1, "kalender")
  [ 38] ret
end
